  "releaseNotes": "- Options now support overridable UseDefaults() which needs to be called by packages using hosting.\n- Options now support overridable AddMandatoryServices() which need sto be called by packages using hosting.\n- Options now configure Azure App Configuration and will call OnAppConfigurationMiddlewareNeeded if startup needs its middleware.\n- A bunch of new options to react to app startups.\n- New HostRunner is the new central starting point of every app (web or console) which will define the app lifetime.",
